* '''Player:''' I can't double-cross you if I was never working with you to begin with! Besides, we have more important things to worry about than treasure.
* '''Asgarnia Smith:''' Oh, I see what's happening! You're trying to trick me so you can take the treasure for yourself!
* '''Player:''' Listen to me! We're not the only ones trying to get into this place! There was this woman who kept trying to steal the medallions. Someone sent her!
* '''Asgarnia Smith:''' Well of course there will be others who want the treasure! All the more reason for you to stop messing around.
* '''Player:''' I'm not going any further until we work out what's going on.
* '''Asgarnia Smith:''' I really thought you had what it takes, kid, but you're just another fool. If you won't help me find the treasure, I'll just have to do it myself!
