==Skill guide description==
* {{tbox|pic=Watering can(4).png|Farming allows you to grow various flowers, vegetables, trees, herbs and more in farming patches across Gielinor.}}
* {{tbox|pic=Potato seed 5.png|To get started, you'll need some seeds and a seed dibber, as well as a rake to de-weed the patch you want to use.}}
* {{tbox|pic=rake.png|Once you've cleared the patch, you can add your seed to it. You can also optionally water it with a watering can or add a bucket of compost to decrease the chances of your plant becoming diseased.}}
* {{tbox|pic=seed dibber.png|It'll take a while for your plant to grow, so feel free to explore the world and come back to it later!}}
* {{tbox|pic=potato.png|Once your plant has grown, you might need another tool to collect the harvest. For instance, you'll need a spade to dig up potatoes.}}
* {{tbox|pic=plant cure.png|If you're worried about your crops becoming diseased, most crops can be protected by the nearby gardeners, but they'll want specific produce in return.}}
* {{tbox|pic=compost.png|As your Farming level increases, you'll gain access to more crops to grow, as well as obtaining{{sic}} greater yields when harvesting.}}

