==Skill guide description==
* {{tbox|pic=feather.png|Fletching allows you to create various ranged weapons, as well as ammunition to go with them.}}
* {{tbox|pic=bow string.png|Making bows requires bowstring, which can be made from flax at a spinning wheel. You can use a knife on some logs to carve an unfinished bow, then add the bowstring to complete the weapon.}}
* {{tbox|pic=Headless arrow 5.png|To create arrows, you’ll first need to carve logs into arrow shafts with a knife, then tip the arrow shafts with feathers. Finally, you’ll need to add some arrow heads.}}
* {{tbox|pic=Mithril bolts (unf) 3.png|To make bolts, you only need to combine unfinished bolts with feathers. You can also chisel gemstones down into bolt tips, with each gemstone being able to top a different bolt.}}

