[Clearly torn from a diary, one excerpt stands out to you in particular...]

The potions made here are unlike the other potions I've encountered. For starters, no herb is required in the creation process. Instead, simply water and a crushed up grub is sufficient. In addition, the properties of the potion appear to be uniquely based on the proficiency of the herbalist who created it, with it able to mimic the effects of various combat enhancing potions that the mixer is capable of producing. It's honestly quite fascinating.

