<nowiki>*most of this script is unreadable, but you can make sense of a few sections*</nowiki>


Dance move: Spinny dervish

Two dancers go the front of the stage, two go to the back.
Everybody spin and sing.
Swap positions - front goes to the back, back goes to the front.
Spin and sing again!
Return to start position.


Dance move: Jolly jig

Form a square, a dancer in each corner.
Everybody jig and sing.
Everyone move clockwise, then jig and sing again!
Return to start position, then jig again and make some noise!


Dance move: Under'n'round Pass

Everyone walk forwards, two dancers stop before the front of the stage and jump for joy.
The other two dancers walk around them anti-clockwise.
All dancers sing.
Once the two moving dancers return to the line, jump for joy again.
Return to start position, then all jump for joy and sing.


Dance move: Big Hopper

Everyone walk to the front of the stage.
Everybody hop and sing.
Return to start position, everyone hop and sing again.


