* '''Garkor:''' Trust me; we too have considered this, but whilst it is possible for one, it is near impossible for three.
* '''Garkor:''' We have considered many things. I have my squad mage and sappers working below us right now. My, assassin Karam, is operating in the village itself.
* '''Garkor:''' I remain here so that I may overhear Awowogei's plans.
* '''Player:''' Awowogei?
* '''Garkor:''' The self-proclaimed ruler of the island. I have been listening to him for some time now. I believe we will incur a minimum of casualties if we have an insider - a monkey working for us.
