* '''Zooknock:''' For the spells to take full effect, they will have to be in some way related to the monkeys.
* '''Zooknock:''' I suggest that I invest the ability to communicate with the monkeys in an authentic monkey amulet.
* '''Zooknock:''' Similarly, the transformation spell should be stored in a monkey talisman of some kind.
