===Introduction===
* '''Nomad:''' Welcome to Soul Wars! Let's get started.
* '''Player:''' So, what's this place all about?
* '''Nomad:''' To the south you will have seen an avatar. You must fight to protect your team's avatar, and defeat the opposing team's avatar.
* '''Player:''' Are you crazy? Have you seen the size of it?
* '''Nomad:''' You're here to fight, not whine.
* '''Player:''' But how am I supposed to take on one of those?
* '''Nomad:''' By capturing the Soul Obelisk, which lies at the centre of the battleground, and offering it soul fragments.
* '''Nomad:''' Let's head towards the Obelisk now. I can point out some of the important landmarks on the way. Meet me to the north when you are ready to learn more.
* {{qact|The screen fades to black and Nomad teleports northwards.}}

