* '''Ramarno:''' But that which was once great can still be great again! We Imcando Dwarves know that better than most. There is hope for the future of Camdozaal. But I need help.
* '''Player:''' What do you need?
* '''Ramarno:''' We have a Sacred Forge. You will find none other like it in all the world. Some of the greatest weapons of legend started life here.
