* '''Player:''' Fuel?
* '''Ramarno:''' Barronite. You'll only find it in these ruins. If you can gather some for me, I can use it to keep the Forge lit. In return, I'll let you take what you want from our Great Vault.
* '''Ramarno:''' I no longer have use for anything in the Vault. Besides, material possessions mean nothing compared to the fire of the Sacred Forge.
* '''Player:''' So I find barronite in the ruins and bring it to you? Doesn't sound too difficult. Where should I start?
