** '''Ramarno:''' I'm glad they didn't win, I suppose. But it doesn't change much for me. I am still the last Imcando Dwarf.
** '''Player:''' I'm sorry Ramarno. I will do my best to help ensure the legacy of your kin lives on.
** '''Ramarno:''' Thank you, [player name]. That gives me some hope. If you have any more questions, do not hesitate to ask.
