** '''Sedridor:''' You haven't guessed? This talisman you brought me... it is the key to the elemental altar of air! When you hold it next, it will direct you towards
** '''Sedridor:''' the entrance to the long forgotten Air Altar! By bringing pieces of the Rune Essence to the Air Temple, you will be able to fashion your own Air Runes!
** '''Sedridor:''' And this is not all! By finding other talismans similar to this one, you will eventually be able to craft every rune that is available on this world! Just
** '''Sedridor:''' as our ancestors did! I cannot stress enough what a find this is! Now, due to the risks involved of letting this mighty power fall into the wrong hands
** '''Sedridor:''' I will keep the teleport skill to the Rune Essence a closely guarded secret, shared only by myself and those Magic users around the world whom I trust enough to keep it.
