* <s> I delivered the Package to Aubury in Varrock. He confirmed Sedridor's suspicions and asked me to take some Research Notes back to him. I did so, and Sedridor used them to discover the Teleportation Incantation to the lost Rune Essence Mine. As a thank you for my help, he granted me permission to use the Rune Essence Mine whenever I please.</s>
