==Finishing up==
===Talking to Curator Haig Halen===
* '''Curator Haig Halen:''' Welcome to the museum of Varrock.
* '''Player:''' I have half the shield of Arrav here. Can I get a reward?
* '''Curator Haig Halen:''' The Shield of Arrav! Goodness, the Museum has been searching for that for years! The late King Roald II offered a reward for it years ago!
* '''Player:''' Well, I'm here to claim it.
* '''Curator Haig Halen:''' Let me have a look at it first.
** {{tbox|pic=Broken shield (left) detail.png|The curator peers at the shield.}}
* '''Curator Haig Halen:''' This is incredible!
* '''Curator Haig Halen:''' That shield has been missing for over twenty-five years!
* '''Curator Haig Halen:''' Leave the shield here with me and I'll write you out a certificate saying that you have returned the shield, so that you can claim your reward from the King.
* '''Player:''' Can I have two certificates please?
* '''Curator Haig Halen:''' Yes, certainly. Please hand over the shield.
** {{tbox|pic=Broken shield (left) detail.png|You hand over the shield half.}}
** {{tbox|pic=Half certificate (left) detail.png|The curator writes out two half-certificates.}}
* '''Curator Haig Halen:''' Of course you won't actually be able to claim the reward with only half the reward certificates...
* '''Player:''' What? I went through a lot of trouble to get that shield piece and now you tell me it was for nothing? That's not very fair!
* '''Curator Haig Halen:''' Well, if you were to get me the other half of the shield, I could give you the other half of the reward certificate. It's rumoured to be in the possession of the infamous Blackarm{{sic}} Gang, beyond that I can't help you.
* '''Player:''' Okay, I'll see what I can do.
* {{tact|end}}

===Talking to King Roald before obtaining a full certificate===
* '''Player:''' Greetings, your majesty.
* '''Player:''' Your majesty, I have recovered the Shield of Arrav; I would like to claim the reward.
* {{tcond|If the player has no certificate.}}
** '''King Roald:''' The Shield of Arrav, eh? Yes, I do recall my father, King Roald, put a reward out for that.
** '''King Roald:''' Very well.
** '''King Roald:''' If you get the authenticity of the shield verified by the curator at the museum and then return here with authentication, I will grant you your reward.
** {{tact|end}}
* {{tcond|If the player has a half-certificate.}}
** {{tbox|pic=Half certificate (left) detail.png|You show the certificate to the king.}}
** '''King Roald:''' I'm afraid that's only half the reward certificate. You'll have to get the other half and join them together if you want to claim the reward.
** {{tact|end}}

===Talking to King Roald after obtaining a full certificate===
* '''Player:''' Greetings, your majesty.
* '''Player:''' Your majesty, I have come to claim the reward for the return of the Shield Of Arrav.
* {{tbox|pic=Certificate (Shield of Arrav) detail.png|You show the certificate to the king.}}
* '''King Roald:''' My goodness! This claim is for the reward offered by my father many years ago!
* '''King Roald:''' I never thought I would live to see the day when someone came forward to claim this reward!
* '''King Roald:''' I heard that you found half the shield, so I will give you half of the bounty. That comes to exactly 600gp!
* {{tbox|pic=Coins 250 detail.png|You hand over a certificate. The king gives you 600gp.}}
* {{tact|end}}
