* '''King Bolrie:''' Liar! You deceived me!
* '''Glouphrie the Untrusted:''' No, I simply told you what you wanted to hear, Bolrie. Never forget that...
* '''Bolrie:''' {{Colour|#000080|There ended my campaign to become the new king of the Gnome Stronghold. Argenthorg was crowned soon after and Glouphrie disappeared once more.}}
