** {{topt|Dialogue 3}}
*** '''Town crier:''' Did you know that Free-to-Play P-mods CAN visit the moderator forums, by logging into the regular forums at the top right hand side of the forum screen, despite it saying Members only.
** {{topt|Dialogue 4}}
*** '''Town crier:''' Don't be tempted to report anything you didn't see, no matter how much you trust the player who is informing you.
** {{topt|Dialogue 5}}
*** '''Town crier:''' Don't eat something messy when on a first date - it won't look good!
** {{topt|Dialogue 6}}
*** '''Town crier:''' Don't forget to add the mute if needed, before selecting the report category. This cuts down on those duplicate reports for one player.
** {{topt|Dialogue 7}}
*** '''Town crier:''' Feeling harassed? Don't forget your ignore list can be especially useful if a player seems to be picking on you!
