* <s>With the Assassins dealt with, Thaerisk asked me to investigate a treasure hunter called Movario who he believed had worked with Lucien. He suggested I start my search at the Fight Arena as Movario hired a bodyguard from there called Darve.</s>
* <s>I travelled to the Fight Arena and found a Launderer who knew Movario. He gave me a Dirty Shirt belonging to him and directed me to the Hunting Expert in the Feldip Hills to ask about obtaining a Broav to track Movario with.</s>
* <s>I spoke to the Hunting Expert in the Feldip Hills and she showed me how to catch and train a Broav.</s>
* <s>I returned to the Fight Arena and was able to use my Broav to track Movario's scent to a Hidden Base below the Khazard Battlefield.</s>
* <s>I found some Research Notes within the Hidden Base and took them to Thaerisk in Taverley.</s>
* <s>Thaerisk asked me to head to McGrubor's Wood to find Idria and the Guardians of Armadyl, as he'd lost contact with them. Upon arrival, I found them being attacked by some Mercenaries, but I was able to help defeat them.</s>
* <s>With the Mercenaries dealt with, Idria and I journeyed to the White Knights' Castle in Falador. There we met up with Thaerisk, as well as Akrisae of the Temple Knights.</s>
* <s>I spoke with Thaerisk, Akrisae and Idria about the contents of Movario's Research Notes. They revealed Lucien's desire to find and claim an artefact of unimaginable power called the Stone of Jas.</s>
* <s>To find Lucien, Thaerisk suggested we capture one of his Spies from Draynor Village. As such, I planted a Teleorb given to me by Akrisae on one of them. He then used this Teleorb to teleport the Spy into a cell.</s>
* <s>With the Spy captured, we attempted to interrogate him using some Truth Serum. However, the Spy was able to destroy it.</s>
* <s>To make some more Truth Serum, I prepared an Enriched Snapdragon Seed and planted it in a Specially Prepared Patch on the roof of the White Knights' Castle. While waiting for it to grow, I recruited Turael, Mazchna, Duradel and Cyrisus to our cause.</s>
* <s>I harvested the Enriched Snapdragon and used it to make some new Truth Serum. I then administered the Truth Serum to the Spy and he provided details on an individual known as the Dark Squall.</s>
* <s>Based on the information provided, Idria and Akrisae initiated a search for the Dark Squall. I then recruited Harrallak Menarous, Ghommal and Sloane to our cause. However, while discussing our next steps, Hazelmere arrived and volunteered to join us as well.</s>
* <s>I spoke to Akrisae and he told me there had been a possible sighting of the Dark Squall at the Black Knights' Fortress. He sent Silif to investigate, but lost contact with him. I travelled to the Black Knights' Fortress myself to investigate. I found Silif imprisoned in some Catacombs beneath the Fortress.</s>
* <s>I managed to free Silif from his imprisonment in the Black Knight Catacombs and gave him a Disguise. While he gathered Intelligence, I set out to find the Dark Squall. However, upon finding him, I discovered him to actually be Surok Magis. He recognised me and attacked, but I was able to defeat him and plant a Teleorb on him.</s>
* <s>I returned to the White Knights' Castle and updated the others on what happened in the Black Knight Catacombs. Using information found by Silif, we were able to locate Lucien's Camp near the Wilderness.</s>
* {{Colour|#000080|I travelled to {{Colour|#800000|Lucien's Camp}} and confronted {{Colour|#800000|Lucien}} with the {{Colour|#800000|Heroes}}. However, he was too powerful for us. {{Colour|#800000|Duradel}}, {{Colour|#800000|Turael}}, {{Colour|#800000|Sloane}}, {{Colour|#800000|Cyrisus}}, {{Colour|#800000|Ghommal}} and {{Colour|#800000|Hazelmere}} were all killed. The rest of us were forced to flee. I should return to the {{Colour|#800000|White Knights' Castle}} and let the others know what happened.}}

